<title>USA: Fortress 1996 new home orders rose 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Fortress 1996 new home orders rose 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortress Group Inc on Friday said its new orders for homes rose 34 percent to 1,502 in 1996 from 1,095 the previous year.</p>
<p>Cancellations made in the second and third quarter of 1966 were recorded in the fourth quarter, which had the effect of significantly reducing the company's net new orders for the that quarter, it said.</p>
<p>For the fourth quarter of 1996, the company said its orders, net of cancellations, declined 9 percent.</p>
</text>
